  honshiken_school_koko_ritsumeikan_eigo_12: {
    caption: "例　I prefer going out on weekends. …",
    slides: [
      {"note":"理由を2つあげて、40語以上50語以内で書く。","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":0,"w":320,"h":240,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF"},{"t":"box","x":10,"y":8,"w":300,"h":34,"text":"テーマ：週末は、家で過ごすのと外出するのと、どち\nらが好きか。","color":"#0284C7","fill":"#E0F2FE","size":12},{"t":"box","x":10,"y":50,"w":300,"h":22,"text":"条件：理由を2つ、40語以上50語以内","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#F1EFEA","size":11},{"t":"box","x":0,"y":146,"w":320,"h":94,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF"},{"t":"box","x":12,"y":148,"w":296,"h":40.5,"text":"理由を2つあげて、40語以上50語以内で書\nく。","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":13}]},
      {"note":"構成：①立場（I prefer …）→ ②理由1（First, …）→ ③理由2（Second, …）→ ④まとめ。","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":146,"w":320,"h":94,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF"},{"t":"box","x":12,"y":148,"w":296,"h":56.8,"text":"構成：①立場（I prefer …）→ ②理由1（\nFirst, …）→ ③理由2（Second, …）→ ④\nまとめ。","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":13},{"t":"box","x":10,"y":80,"w":300,"h":24,"text":"立場 → 理由1 → 理由2 → まとめ","color":"#B5622E","fill":"#FEF9C3","size":12}]},
      {"note":"立場：I prefer going out on weekends.（prefer は動名詞を続けられる）","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":146,"w":320,"h":94,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF"},{"t":"box","x":12,"y":148,"w":296,"h":40.5,"text":"立場：I prefer going out on\nweekends.（prefer は動名詞を続けられる）","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":13}]},
      {"note":"理由1：First, I can get fresh air and exercise, so I feel better on Monday.","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":146,"w":320,"h":94,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF"},{"t":"box","x":12,"y":148,"w":296,"h":40.5,"text":"理由1：First, I can get fresh air and\nexercise, so I feel better on Monday.","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":13}]},
      {"note":"理由2：Second, I can meet my friends and enjoy talking with them.","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":146,"w":320,"h":94,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF"},{"t":"box","x":12,"y":148,"w":296,"h":40.5,"text":"理由2：Second, I can meet my friends and\nenjoy talking with them.","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":13}]},
      {"note":"まとめ：Staying home is comfortable, but I think going out makes my weekend more exciting.　語数：45語。40〜50語の範囲に入っている。","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":146,"w":320,"h":94,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF"},{"t":"box","x":12,"y":148,"w":296,"h":56.8,"text":"まとめ：Staying home is comfortable,\nbut I think going out makes my weekend\nmore exciting.","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":13},{"t":"box","x":12,"y":208.8,"w":296,"h":24.3,"text":"語数：45語。40〜50語の範囲に入っている。","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":13}]},
      {"note":"例　I prefer going out on weekends. First, I can get fresh air and exercise, so I feel better on Monday. Second, I can meet my friends and enjoy talking with them. Staying home is comfortable, but I think going out makes my weekend more exciting.","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":0,"w":320,"h":240,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF"},{"t":"box","x":22,"y":44,"w":276,"h":152,"text":"例　I prefer going out on weekends\n. First, I can get fresh air and\nexercise, so I feel better on\nMonday. Second, I can meet my\nfriends and enjoy talking with\nthem. Staying home is comfortable\n, but I think going out makes my\nweekend more exciting.","color":"#16A34A","fill":"#DCFCE7","size":14}]},
      {"note":"よくあるまちがい　理由が1つしかない。語数が足りない・多すぎる。立場がはっきりしない。","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":0,"w":320,"h":240,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF"},{"t":"box","x":10,"y":8,"w":300,"h":34,"text":"テーマ：週末は、家で過ごすのと外出するのと、どち\nらが好きか。","color":"#0284C7","fill":"#E0F2FE","size":12},{"t":"box","x":10,"y":50,"w":300,"h":22,"text":"条件：理由を2つ、40語以上50語以内","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#F1EFEA","size":11},{"t":"box","x":0,"y":146,"w":320,"h":94,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF"},{"t":"box","x":12,"y":148,"w":296,"h":24.3,"text":"よくあるまちがい","color":"#E11D48","fill":"#FFE4E6","size":13},{"t":"box","x":12,"y":176.3,"w":296,"h":40.5,"text":"理由が1つしかない。語数が足りない・多す\nぎる。立場がはっきりしない。","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":13}]},
    ],
  },
